### REST requests for IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### List products (seeded on first start)
GET {{base}}/api/products

### 1. Happy path: payment -> inventory -> shipping -> notification -> COMPLETED
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "customerEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "221B Baker Street, London",
  "paymentToken": "tok_visa",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "LAPTOP-001", "quantity": 1 },
    { "sku": "MOUSE-001", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 2. Transient gateway errors: Temporal retries payment, order still COMPLETES
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Flaky Fred",
  "customerEmail": "fred@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "1 Main St",
  "paymentToken": "tok_flaky",
  "items": [ { "sku": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 3. Card declined: FAILED, nothing reserved or shipped
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Declined Dan",
  "customerEmail": "dan@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "1 Main St",
  "paymentToken": "tok_declined",
  "items": [ { "sku": "PHONE-001", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 4. Out of stock (MONITOR-001 has only 2): payment REFUNDED, order FAILED
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Greedy Greg",
  "customerEmail": "greg@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "1 Main St",
  "paymentToken": "tok_visa",
  "items": [ { "sku": "MONITOR-001", "quantity": 5 } ]
}

### 5. Undeliverable address: inventory RELEASED + payment REFUNDED, order FAILED
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Lost Larry",
  "customerEmail": "larry@example.com",
  "shippingAddress": "UNDELIVERABLE island",
  "paymentToken": "tok_visa",
  "items": [ { "sku": "HEADPHONES-001", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### List orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders

### Order from MySQL (replace the order number)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-XXXXXXXX

### Live workflow status + progress query from Temporal
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-XXXXXXXX/workflow

### Everything each service recorded (payment, reservations, shipment, notifications)
GET {{base}}/api/orders/ORD-XXXXXXXX/audit

### Create or update a product / restock
PUT {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "MONITOR-001", "name": "27\" 4K monitor", "price": 349.00, "availableQuantity": 20 }
